  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the basmati rice until the water runs clear, then drain.",
    "In a medium saucepan, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander and turmeric, sauté for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the saffron soak and rice, coating the grains.",
    "Pour in the water and coconut milk, season with salt, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes until the liquid is absorbed.",
    "Stir in the raisins, shredded queso fresco, and fermented kimchi.",
    "Remove from heat and let the pilaf steam, covered, for 5 minutes.",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork, transfer to a serving dish.",
    "Garnish with extra cheese if desired."
  ],
